## 📂 Key Files & Roles

| Path | Primary Responsibility |
| :--- | :--- |
| **[src/index.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/index.js)** | Entrypoint. Mounts Express middleware, dashboard statics, API routes, and initiates the WhatsApp client connection. |
| **[src/config/index.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/config/index.js)** | Consolidates environment configuration (`dotenv`), setups fallback provider priorities, and exports authentication passwords. |
| **[src/whatsapp/client.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/whatsapp/client.js)** | Instantiates the Baileys socket, prints QR codes to the terminal on status updates, saves session credentials to disk (`/sessions`), and pushes new notifications to the Message Handler. |
| **[src/whatsapp/messageHandler.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/whatsapp/messageHandler.js)** | Filters incoming messages (discards group chats, status feeds, empty stickers, and own messages), updates chat presence to "composing...", and coordinates AI reply generation. |
| **[src/whatsapp/sender.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/whatsapp/sender.js)** | Shared handler for outbound WhatsApp socket messaging (e.g. notifications triggered by status changes in the admin dashboard). |
| **[src/ai/agent.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/ai/agent.js)** | Core controller. Creates/updates conversation states in the database, retrieves message history, iterates through active AI providers, handles fallbacks, and logs final responses. |
| **[src/ai/systemPrompt.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/ai/systemPrompt.js)** | Configures the Swahili sales persona. Instructs the model to stay brief, format WhatsApp text with asterisks (bold) and underscores (italics), query products using `search_products`, collect customer data individually, and format order confirmation receipts. |
| **[src/ai/tools/index.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/ai/tools/index.js)** | Declares tool parameters for function calling (`search_products`, `get_all_categories`, and `create_order`). Contains execution logic that writes to the database, decrements inventory stock, and catches duplicate orders. |
| **[src/ai/fallback.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/ai/fallback.js)** | Simple local keyword-matching engine. Returns immediate product suggestions or general messages when all AI APIs fail. |
| **[src/ai/businessAdvisor.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/ai/businessAdvisor.js)** | Admin facing analysis layer. Queries database metrics directly for general dashboard stats, gathers customer conversation histories to prompt Gemini for buying likelihoods, and generates business suggestions. |
| **[src/routes/api.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/routes/api.js)** | REST endpoints for dashboard operations (adding products, confirming/canceling orders, pulling message lists, updating contact types). |
| **[src/routes/insights.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry%20Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/routes/insights.js)** | REST endpoints exposing business stats, potential customers, general advice, and custom QA queries to the dashboard. |

